{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ starbucks boycott \"race together\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_436895360#7_924146849","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3344","rank":2,"snippet":"sued for using too much ice Their \"war on Christmas\" with plain red cups in 2015 The Green Cup in 2016 was a problem as well The homosexual holiday cup of 2017 They said they would hire refugees — and people weren't having it The pumpkin-less Pumpkin Spice Latte They were accused of stealing their unicorn drink They tried and failed at the <cover>Race Together campaign #TrumpCup turned things political Racial profiling in Philadelphia Their racial bias training drew more controversy Starbucks said they were ditching plastic straws \" , \"segment\": \"Much social media backlash ensued, with many backing Feuerstein, and many defending Starbucks. Even then-presidential candidate Donald Trump weighed in on the issue, saying \\\"I have one of the most successful Starbucks, in Trump Tower. Maybe we should boycott </cover>Starbucks? I don't know. Seriously, I don't care... If I become president, we're all going to be saying Merry Christmas again, that I can tell you.\" The Green Cup in 2016 was a problem as well Getty Images In November 2016, Starbucks made a big statement when they released their new \"Green Unity Cup.\" The cup was meant to symbolize unity ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_436895360#9_924151111","rank":1,"relevance":2}]}}
